/*!
\page page_stfmstriggerdetector StFmsTriggerDetector

\brief FMS trigger detector data: multi-level DSM chain outputs and raw QT board data.

\section stfmstriggerdetector_overview Overview
\c StFmsTriggerDetector stores data from the Forward Meson Spectrometer (FMS) trigger
system.  The FMS covers 2.5 < η < 4.0 and uses lead-glass calorimeter cells to select
forward photons and π⁰s.  This class records Layer-0 through Layer-2 DSM output words
and raw QT board ADC/TDC values for offline trigger verification.

\section stfmstriggerdetector_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StFmsTriggerDetector
\endcode

\section stfmstriggerdetector_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| unsigned short[] | DSM / DSM01 / DSM02 | Layer-0 DSM output words |
| unsigned short[] | DSM1 | Layer-1 DSM output words |
| unsigned short[] | DSM2 | Layer-2 DSM output words |
| raw QT arrays | — | QT board ADC/TDC words |

\section stfmstriggerdetector_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `int nHit() const` | Number of hits above threshold |
| `int hit(int line) const` | Hit pattern for trigger line |
| `int adc(int crate, int addr, int dcard, int dch) const` | QT board ADC |
| `int tdc(int crate, int addr, int dcard, int dch) const` | QT board TDC |
| `unsigned short DSM(int ch) const` | Layer-0 DSM word ch |
| `unsigned short DSM1(int ch) const` | Layer-1 DSM word ch |
| `unsigned short DSM2(int ch) const` | Layer-2 DSM word ch |

\section stfmstriggerdetector_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StFmsTriggerDetector& fms = event->triggerDetectorCollection()->fms();
cout << "FMS nHit = " << fms.nHit() << endl;
\endcode

\see \ref page_sttriggerdetectorcollection
\see \ref page_stfpdtriggerdetector
*/
